window.Pattove.documentPages["doc-f176f136e3"]={"html":"<h2 id=\"doc-이전-브랜드-적용-이미지-제작-기록\">이전 브랜드 적용 이미지 제작 기록</h2>\n<p>현재 화면의 슬로건 제거 전에 제작한 이력이다. 내장 <code>image_gen</code>으로 제작했다. 기준 입력은 실제 SVG와 서체를 브라우저에서 렌더한 <code>01-브랜드-정본.png</code>다. 생성한 적용 이미지는 종이와 그림자의 표현을 검토하는 보조 자료이며, 제품의 로고 정본은 <code>assets/mark.svg</code>, 화면 정본은 <code>index.html</code>이다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use case: logo-brand\nAsset type: PATTOVE digital product brand presentation, landscape 3:2.\nPrimary request: Create a refined, distinctive editorial brand application image for a Korean visual UI pattern dictionary named &quot;pattove&quot; / &quot;패토브&quot;. This is a branding companion to the actual working UI, not a new app redesign.\nInput images: Image 1 is the canonical brand board. Preserve its EXACT split P symbol with separate small diamond, lowercase pattove spelling and thick geometric wordmark style. Preserve the four color roles. It is a strict identity reference.\nComposition: A highly polished flat lay with a large printed white identity sheet occupying the left two thirds, a vivid blue square identity card at upper right, a small dark ink card at lower right, and a narrow lime accent strip. The left sheet has a very large logo and wordmark and only the Korean tagline below. Clear intentional grid, sophisticated whitespace, authentic paper edge detail and subtle soft natural shadows. View straight from above. Strong graphic design rather than miscellaneous merchandise.\nPalette: cobalt #284CEB, ink #17203A, pale paper #F7F8FC, small lime #E9F29B. Dominant white, strong blue area.\nText (verbatim, no additional copy): &quot;pattove&quot;, &quot;패토브&quot;, &quot;이름을 몰라도, 모양을 보면.&quot;, &quot;UI PATTERN DICTIONARY&quot;.\nConstraints: exact logo geometry and name continuity across applications. No book/bookmark icon, no generic sparkles, no gradients, no devices, no extra words, no invented URL, no trademark or registered marks. Korean text accurate. Do not alter or reproduce the reference app as a fabricated screenshot. This image is a brand application study.\n</code></pre>\n","toc":[]};
